# Constraint with [each ...] keyword for multi-class intersection
# Tests that fn@[bind: [a] constraint: [a: [each Comparable Printable]] return: a]
# applies both Comparable and Printable constraints to TypeVar 'a'
[
  compare-and-show: [fn@[bind: [a] constraint: [a: [each Comparable Printable]] return: a]
    [let x@a] x]
  result: [compare-and-show 42]
]

---

%.result
=== out
Int(42)
